<title>USA: MEDIQ says to redeem convertible debentures.</title>
<headline>MEDIQ says to redeem convertible debentures.</headline>
<dateline>PENNSAUKEN, N.J. 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>MEDIQ Inc said on Thursday that it has elected to redeem all of its 7-1/4 percent convertible subordinated debentures due 2006 on February 28, 1997.</p>
<p>The debentures will be redeemed at a price of $1,017.52 per $1,000 of principal, including accrued interest, MEDIQ said.</p>
<p>MEDIQ said the debentures were originally issued in 1986 and $13.3 million in principal is currently outstanding.</p>
